Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：将飞散四处的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重新收集起来，便开始运转{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个巨大的拼图。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其数量与飞散四处的我的记忆相同　99。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座建筑物是某种讯息吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么　这种东西会在游马的钥匙里…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说我会失去记忆这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人早就预测到了吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟到　迟到　要迟到了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿～呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！　哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看不见信号灯…　啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…　鲨鱼。

Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼那家伙，跑哪去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喇叭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶上了……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）游马同学。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……咦？没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡只有那家伙在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才会放进卡组里。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是决斗的幽灵啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯嗯嗯……你在说什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，总之
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有 No.卡这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的游马君就是个废柴决斗者呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 那种说法。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那岂不是 至今为止我能赢下来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是靠 No.卡和那家伙的力量嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那当然是这样吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话 游马君{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能赢过鲨鱼和德之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这群家伙！ 根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.62,0:02:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的一飞冲天有多厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的决斗斯芬克斯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是猛得不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斯芬克斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）要说的话 那是战术才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君就是游马的人类翻译机呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 游马君
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算没有 No.卡也很强这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能证明给我们看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然能！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我就再和鲨鱼决斗一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用 No.卡赢下来就行了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 那样的话游马君的实力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也可以认可了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我这就去鲨鱼那儿…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最近 听说那家伙都没来学校啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为在和你的决斗中输了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的名声一落千丈了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传闻说他跟一些不三不四的家伙混在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎光临。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天也感谢各位光临本店。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的那群家伙 根本不懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我比起以前已经完全变强了这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要去哪里？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 现在才冒出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为你才搞得这么麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要再和鲨鱼决斗一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼… 那个使用 No.卡少年吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但为什么要和他？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不用知道。你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟这场决斗没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，被牵扯进来我才头疼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）等等啊，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈……游马你真的打算去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不去见鲨鱼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没法决斗了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这里吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼就在这里啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂，很危险啊，这地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个奇怪的地方啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回去吧，求你了！这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）有什么事？你们这帮小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里可是本大爷的地盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！放开我……哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）挺有气势的嘛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个刺头小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陆王，海王大哥{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我跟你决斗，快放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是算了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和他的体格差距一目了然。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥，这帮家伙怎么处理？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干脆收拾掉算了，呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）把他们放了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙 是你认识的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.27,0:06:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算你们捡回一条命。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）这里不是你们该来的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是有事找才来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再和我决斗一次吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 那不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经 不决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟／游马）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再也不会 有那个打算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}堕落了呀 鲨鱼也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那对兄弟可是 挂了号的决斗者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到处参加各种大会还干着近乎恐吓的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他为什么放弃决斗了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊……那家伙为什么放弃决斗了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然是因为输给你了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么输给我就要放弃决斗啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输了也会失去一些东西的……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输了会失去的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来，鲨鱼那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始变坏是在决斗的全国大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出场的时候——我听过这种说法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候也可能发生了什么事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明应该是很喜欢决斗的……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？游马呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像急匆匆地回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说游马那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟那种不良少年混在一起有什么好玩的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你懂什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要决斗就能了解对方的一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，跟我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经不决斗了！别管我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！等等！

Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天～……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜，哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈，哈，哈……终于放弃了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！跟我……决斗……快。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么放弃决斗啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙到底是什么人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么对我这么执着啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然是因为我们是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要决斗过一次就不再是外人，是同伴了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事，你也应该感受到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……那种话是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是认真的。如果我赢了你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就退出不良团体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。那你赌什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……赌这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别后悔啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定要让你失去最
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你真的打算做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗你应该说过你与此无关。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在这场决斗中不会使用 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡只能用 No.卡来打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，鲨鱼已经没有 No.卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对没有 No.卡的人使用 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种卑鄙的事我做得出来吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我的实力也比以前强了相当多。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:11:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算没有你的力量我也一定会赢给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。我就静观其变吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我输给你这件事我可没忘记》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《或许我内心深处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在等待着这一刻》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了。决斗盘 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了。我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（隆隆隆石人）隆隆～。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他使用的怪兽很强。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光靠隆隆隆石人的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻的第一个回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我盖下的卡是 战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方发动攻击时破坏那只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是终结战斗的陷阱。 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没那么容易攻击了》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。 我召唤杀手深海鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（杀手深海鲨） killer～。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杀手深海鲨 攻击力是700。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底在盘算什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再 特殊召唤鲨鱼足球员。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼足球员）鲨鱼足球～。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在鱼族怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的杀手深海鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼足球员叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 潜航母舰 航空鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1900。 比隆隆隆石人还高吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我有能阻止鲨鱼攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动潜航母舰 航空鲨的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对方造成400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我持有的手牌是4张。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此你要承受1600的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动速攻魔法旋风，从手牌发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}旋风会破坏场上的魔法·陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，航空鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆石人。大食者。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）好厉害！仅仅1个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值就掉到2300了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然鲨鱼强得离谱啊。游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该是抱着打倒我的决心来的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来把落魄的我再一次打败
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来嘲笑我的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！我根本不是那个意思……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去，什么都做不到就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是能用 No.卡的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《啊，这是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次，可以让这张卡的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在1到8之中可以随意改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我的手牌里有死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 只要复活隆隆隆石人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能在场上召唤希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我说过这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不使用 No.卡 但是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 召唤 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的王牌！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊 鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡只能靠 No.卡来打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事他应该明白才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 召唤 No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用那张卡你觉得能赢我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然我 接受了这场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有战胜使用 No.卡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是有意义的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《确实鲨鱼强得离谱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要在这里赢鲨鱼的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你打算用 No.卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说过，你在这场决斗中使用 No.卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就等于用了卑鄙的手段你是这么说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我不反对。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想失去皇之钥。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是为了获胜的手段，就用 No.卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对，说得没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗我的自尊什么的根本不是问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须得把鲨鱼救回来才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我墓地里的隆隆隆石人复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和隆隆隆石人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！现身吧 No.39！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:17:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍普！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马竟然用了 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙明明约好不用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 游马同学的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是靠 No.卡嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了啊 No.卡。让我燃起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击空气鲨！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动杀手皱鳃鲨的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将送去墓地的杀手皱鳃鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方1只怪兽的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降５００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.57,0:17:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动　鱼雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是鱼族怪兽被除外时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将等级３以下的鱼族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大嘴鲨）鲨～鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧…连霍普都
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法破坏空气鲨吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那手是你急于求胜的失误。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死者苏生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也可以从对方的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你从鲨鱼的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活杀手腔棘鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再使用我我我魔术师的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把复生龙超量召唤的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杀人皱鳃鲨的效果就不会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 用复生龙的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功破坏了空气鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 吵死了！ 还没问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力是2000。 鲨鱼的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力比霍普高的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动空气鲨的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你受到400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是2张。 因此 你要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.41,0:19:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到800点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要召唤骷髅章鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌。 他可是拥有 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有能破坏霍普的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级3的骷髅海怪和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！黑鳍枪兵！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑鳍枪兵的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除1个超量素材 这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只怪兽的效果无效！什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽说 No.怪兽不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但说到底那也不过是卡的效果而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要效果消失就能破坏它！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！霍普的……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的效果竟然被无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雷枪兵 黑枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普竟然被干掉了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个少年 竟然知道 No.的弱点……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空鲨 直接攻击！大食者！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.15,0:20:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 就是完败……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马输了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……骗人的吧 明明用了 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也太没手感了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然输给你这种水平的决斗者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还失去了一切……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是笑死人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定，这家伙我就收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西当然是因为是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种东西，连破坏的价值都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！你这家伙，根本不明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是自愿待在那帮家伙身边的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那帮家伙给了无处可去的我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个容身之处。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再跟我扯上关系了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……

Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题！魔法卡中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以在对方回合发动的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备魔法？还是速攻魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是速攻魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.33,0:24:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡基本上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.33,0:24:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然只能在自己的回合使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但速攻魔法在对手回合也能使用。

